OL,3,AIndia's opposition holds mega rally
OL,4,Aseeking election chief's resignation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people have
OL,7,Fgathered in India's capital Delhi for a
OL,8,Fmajor opposition rally demanding the
OL,9,Fresignation of the country's chief
OL,10,Felection commissioner over a
OL,11,Fcontroversial revision of voter lists.
OL,13,FThe rally, organised by the opposition
OL,14,FINDIA bloc and led by Rahul Gandhi's
OL,15,FCongress party, has brought together
OL,16,Fsome of India's most prominent
OL,17,Fpoliticians at Ramlila Maidan, a
OL,18,Fsprawling ground in central Delhi.
OL,20,FThey arrived at the venue on Sunday
OL,21,Fafter travelling in jeeps through
OL,22,Fcrowds of cheering supporters.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
