OL,3,AIndia's opposition holds mega rally
OL,4,Aseeking election chief's resignation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong those attending were Congress
OL,7,Fleaders Sonia Gandhi and Mallikarjun
OL,8,FKharge, as well as Mamata Banerjee,
OL,9,FAkhilesh Yadav and Tejashwi Yadav.
